<meta title="Sonnet 18" author="William Shakespeare" year="1609" language="en"/>

<text xml:space="preserve">
Shall I compare thee to a summer's day?
Thou art more lovely and more temperate:
Rough winds do shake the darling buds of May,
And summer's lease hath all too short a date;

Sometime too hot the eye of heaven shines,
And often is his gold complexion dimm'd;
And every fair from fair sometime declines,
By chance or nature's changing course untrimm'd;

But thy eternal summer shall not fade,
Nor lose possession of that fair thou ow'st;
Nor shall death brag thou wander'st in his shade,
When in eternal lines to time thou grow'st:

So long as men can breathe or eyes can see,
So long lives this, and this gives life to thee.
</text>

<markup xml:space="preserve">
<span id="nj"><span id="n3"><span id="np">Shall</span> <span id="nq">I</span> <span id="nr"><span id="n47">com</span><span id="n48">pare</span></span> <span id="ns">thee</span> <span id="nt">to</span> <span id="nu">a</span> <span id="nv"><span id="n49">sum</span><span id="n4a">mer's</span></span> <span id="nw">day</span>?</span>
<span id="n4"><span id="nx">Thou</span> <span id="ny">art</span> <span id="nz">more</span> <span id="n10"><span id="n4b">love</span><span id="n4c">ly</span></span> <span id="n11">and</span> <span id="n12">more</span> <span id="n13"><span id="n4d">tem</span><span id="n4e">per</span><span id="n4f">ate</span></span>:</span>
<span id="n5"><span id="n14">Rough</span> <span id="n15">winds</span> <span id="n16">do</span> <span id="n17">shake</span> <span id="n18">the</span> <span id="n19"><span id="n4g">dar</span><span id="n4h">ling</span></span> <span id="n1a">buds</span> <span id="n1b">of</span> <span id="n1c">May</span>,</span>
<span id="n6"><span id="n1d">And</span> <span id="n1e"><span id="n4i">sum</span><span id="n4j">mer's</span></span> <span id="n1f">lease</span> <span id="n1g">hath</span> <span id="n1h">all</span> <span id="n1i">too</span> <span id="n1j">short</span> <span id="n1k">a</span> <span id="n1l">date</span>;</span></span>

<span id="nk"><span id="n7"><span id="n1m">Sometime</span> <span id="n1n">too</span> <span id="n1o">hot</span> <span id="n1p">the</span> <span id="n1q">eye</span> <span id="n1r">of</span> <span id="n1s">heaven</span> <span id="n1t">shines</span>,</span>
<span id="n8"><span id="n1u">And</span> <span id="n1v">often</span> <span id="n1w">is</span> <span id="n1x">his</span> <span id="n1y">gold</span> <span id="n1z">complexion</span> <span id="n20">dimm'd</span>;</span>
<span id="n9"><span id="n21">And</span> <span id="n22">every</span> <span id="n23">fair</span> <span id="n24">from</span> <span id="n25">fair</span> <span id="n26">sometime</span> <span id="n27">declines</span>,</span>
<span id="na"><span id="n28">By</span> <span id="n29">chance</span> <span id="n2a">or</span> <span id="n2b">nature's</span> <span id="n2c">changing</span> <span id="n2d">course</span> <span id="n2e">untrimm'd</span>;</span></span>

<span id="nl"><span id="nb"><span id="n2f">But</span> <span id="n2g">thy</span> <span id="n2h">eternal</span> <span id="n2i">summer</span> <span id="n2j">shall</span> <span id="n2k">not</span> <span id="n2l">fade</span>,</span>
<span id="nc"><span id="n2m">Nor</span> <span id="n2n">lose</span> <span id="n2o">possession</span> <span id="n2p">of</span> <span id="n2q">that</span> <span id="n2r">fair</span> <span id="n2s">thou</span> <span id="n2t">ow'st</span>;</span>
<span id="nd"><span id="n2u">Nor</span> <span id="n2v">shall</span> <span id="n2w">death</span> <span id="n2x">brag</span> <span id="n2y">thou</span> <span id="n2z">wander'st</span> <span id="n30">in</span> <span id="n31">his</span> <span id="n32">shade</span>,</span>
<span id="ne"><span id="n33">When</span> <span id="n34">in</span> <span id="n35">eternal</span> <span id="n36">lines</span> <span id="n37">to</span> <span id="n38">time</span> <span id="n39">thou</span> <span id="n3a">grow'st</span>:</span></span>

<span id="nm"><span id="nf"><span id="n3b">So</span> <span id="n3c">long</span> <span id="n3d">as</span> <span id="n3e">men</span> <span id="n3f">can</span> <span id="n3g">breathe</span> <span id="n3h">or</span> <span id="n3i">eyes</span> <span id="n3j">can</span> <span id="n3k">see</span>,</span>
<span id="ng"><span id="n3l">So</span> <span id="n3m">long</span> <span id="n3n">lives</span> <span id="n3o">this</span>, <span id="n3p">and</span> <span id="n3q">this</span> <span id="n3r">gives</span> <span id="n3s">life</span> <span id="n3t">to</span> <span id="n3u">thee</span>.</span></span>
</markup>

